# Bench: TARGET PASS = forward (store→load forwarding) + DCE (headline win).
# expect: exit 10
# `x:=10; y:=x; return y` lowers to store s0,%1 then slot_addr s0 + load s0 (reads
# back what we just stored), then store s1, slot_addr s1 + load s1. forward replaces
# each load's result with the stored value; the loads + their slot_addrs go dead, so
# DCE prunes them and shrinks func.values -> a smaller FrameLayout (fewer emitted
# load/store/prologue words). Metric: IR instrs drop + emitted aarch64 instrs drop.
fn main() -> int {
    x := 10
    y := x
    return y
}
